## CriminalRecordsCheckEditAll-UC1 — View Criminal Records Check

- Primary Actor(s):
  - Enrollment Administrator
- Secondary Actor(s):
  - None
- Trigger:
  - The Enrollment Administrator accesses the Criminal Records Check section.
- Description:
  - The system displays the criminal records check information for all students.
- Preconditions:
  - The user must have appropriate permissions to view the records.
- Postconditions:
  - The administrator can see the status and details of criminal records checks.
